{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_entry_mc33__e6602b8c_fourteenth_axis_bounded_from_inside", "label": "The Fourteenth Axis, Bounded from Inside (sharp bracket)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC33__e6602b8c.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Intermediate generation of MC33: the bracket [0, 0.416801 %] is proved tight and right-open, zero attained and the supremum not, with two continuations sharing a fourteenth stage of 468,530 cells and parting only at the fifteenth \u2014 which is why no finite number of built stages could fix the limit."}, {"id": "recovered_entry_mc33__e6602b8c_three_continuations", "label": "Three Admissible Continuations of \u039b\u2081\u2083", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC33__e6602b8c.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A chain of caps drives fill to zero, a repeated single cap settles it at 14,880 / 47,775,744 = 0.031146 %, and a translated cap approaches fill(\u039b\u2081\u2083) from below without attaining it \u2014 all closed at E = 0, so admissibility alone cannot decide L."}, {"id": "recovered_entry_mc33__e6602b8c_morphism_admissibility", "label": "Morphism-Admissibility Criterion", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC33__e6602b8c.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "recovered_entry_mc33__e6602b8c_fourteenth_axis_bounded_from_inside", "target": "recovered_entry_mc33_fourteenth_axis_bounded_from_inside", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "recovered/entry-MC33__e6602b8c.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "recovered_entry_mc33__e6602b8c_fourteenth_axis_bounded_from_inside", "target": "recovered_entry_mc33__e6602b